{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も１日お疲れ様です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"W-KEYAKI FES.2022"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足を運んで見に来てくださった皆さま、\n配信から見届けてくださった皆さま、\n本当にありがとうございました‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方の支えがあって\n振替公演という形で同じ場所で\nまたみなさんにお会い出来たことが\n心から嬉しかったです‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全てのことが当たり前な状況ではないからこそ\n皆さんにお会い出来たことが嬉しく、\n２日間とも純粋に楽しんでいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現地に足を運んでくださった皆さん、\n寒暖差が激しかったと思いますが\n体調など大丈夫でしょうか??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0YBVE33C6PDQWYJC5K0CDP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0YBWD8B1BNHFC5E89XZD8D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オープニングの衣装🎀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくかわいくてお気に入りの衣装です‪‪☺︎‬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0YBXBY0YW27T8AZ0FTCZEP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりのちゃんはトロッコですれ違う事が多く\nその度に手を振ってくれて可愛かった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0YBYBNFJERBDMSM2EXR5VC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現地入りした日からずっと隣の席だった。😗\n隣にいてくれて楽しかった。😗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co